        "original_id": "28ee98ce-0f5a-5279-988e-eb017b966dd5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Juskalian\n- Events: Operation Torch, North African Campaign, World War II\n- Places: French North Africa\n\nFacts:\n- On 8 November 1942, Operation Torch began as the British-United States invasion of French North Africa during the North African Campaign of World War II.\n- Operation Torch was initially called Operation Gymnast.\n- During World War II, George Juskalian served with the infantry during the North African Campaign.\n- During World War II, George Juskalian took part in Operation Torch.",
